<p>One look holds a channel together better than any font. The default is <b>Signature</b>: warm-neutral skin, slightly lifted blacks, cooler teal shadows, greens pulled back a touch — and the red (#f22f46) left punchy. The other eight are moods for a series or a trip. Pick one per series and stay with it.</p>
