<p>Strength: 80–100% for a phone photo, 50–70% for a photo that is already edited or very colourful (or use <b>Signature Soft</b>).</p>

<h2 id="recipes">Slider recipes (no LUT needed)</h2>
<p>Every phone editor has the same handful of sliders under slightly different names. Read the table across: <b>Warmth</b> = Temperature, <b>Fade</b> = Lift / Black point up / Matte, <b>Grain</b> = Noise. Values are on the usual −100…+100 scale; tune ±3 by eye.</p>
